🕹️ Features

 We have added a final cutscene for when you win the game;


⚒️ Improvement

   Adjustment to the UI of the menus;
   We have made the "No turkey this Christmas" achievement easier, now instead of 0 kills you have a limit of 10 kills;
   Basement stage improvements;
   It is now possible to play the phase again to get RANK S, without having to start a new game;


👾 Bugfix / Hotifx

 Small bug fixes

👾 Bugfix / Hotifx

 Achievements when completing zones;
loading when starting a level;
 Minor bugs and glitches in the phases fixed;
